# The repo stores text as LF. Windows editors flip working-tree files to CRLF,
# which turns a 900-line change into a 5,000-line whole-file rewrite in every
# diff (and hides the real edit). text=auto normalizes on the way INTO the index
# and leaves the working tree alone, so both platforms stay happy.
* text=auto

# Binary payloads must never be touched: a single LF/CRLF substitution inside a
# GLB/DTS chunk corrupts it silently.
*.glb  binary
*.gltf binary
*.dts  binary
*.DTS  binary
*.blend binary
*.png  binary
*.bmp  binary
*.tga  binary
*.pcx  binary
*.zip  binary
